        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 831, Grace Knob for Cabinets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Grace Cabinet Knob is a simple knob that will add a classic air to any kitchen remodel. As part of the MNG Grace Collection, this 1.25 inch diameter knob is available in the most common finish colors for today's kitchen updates. The Grace Knob for Cabinets is easy to install and comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+Grace\">MNG Grace Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 831 Grace Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
